meta {
  name: Copies
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  # Physical copies

  A physical copy is one specific item of a **physical** book, with its own label, condition,
  storage note and optional location. Ebooks never have copies. A book that has ever had a copy
  can no longer become an ebook.

  Run the folder in order. **Register copies reader** creates its own disposable account and the
  folder creates its own books and location. Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Physical copies").
}
